  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire et nutritionnelle aux refugies maliens et aux populations mauritaniennes vuln&#xE9;rables</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide humanitarian food assistance to the Malian refugees that arrived in the Hodh Chargui region in 2023, as well as to the host population. This WFP project provides cash transfers to vulnerable refugees and host communities to respond to their urgent needs immediately. The project provides life-saving assistance to 20,000 people, including 4,160 women,12,000 children, and including 398 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
